# Data directories (LadybugDB, DuckDB, specialist memory) — root only.
# knowledge-docs/ is source content (example facility docs shipped with the
# repo), not generated state, so it's excepted back in. A parent-directory
# exclude (/data/) can't be undone by negating paths beneath it, hence /data/*
# here instead of /data/.
/data/*
!/data/knowledge-docs/

